lex, high-profile stories. The adjustments reinforced the value of fact-checking in journalism, particularly when public interest and reputations are at stake.\n\n---\n**Section 4**\nFor readers seeking further clarifications, the *Observer*’s Readers’ Editor remains accessible via mail, email (*observer.readers@observer.co.uk*), or phone (020 3353 4736). This direct line encourages accountability and fosters trust between the publication and its audience.\n\n---\n**P.P.S.** No additional commentary provided beyond the requested format.", "logprobs": [{"token": "**", "logprob": -0.2996717393398285}, {"token": "Section", "logprob": -0.005841327365487814}, {"token": " ", "logprob": -0.00010299152199877426}, {"token": "1", "logprob": -0.00018761781393550336}, {"token": "**\n", "logprob": -0.1804783195257187}, {"token": "A", "logprob": -1.3875566720962524}, {"token": " recent", "logprob": -0.2876705527305603}, {"token": " *", "logprob": -1.1528689861297607}, {"token": "Guard", "logprob": -0.002334252465516329}, {"token": "ian", "logprob": -0.00012373158824630082}, {"token": "*", "logprob": -9.965400386136025e-05}, {"token": " article", "logprob": -0.34639105200767517}, {"token": " about", "logprob": -1.8361897468566895}, {"token": " new", "logprob": -1.4628987312316895}, {"token": " legal", "logprob": -0.735075831413269}, {"token": " measures", "logprob": -0.35819211602211}, {"token": " against", "logprob": -1.101800560951233}, {"token": " pet", "logprob": -0.28299713134765625}, {"token": " theft", "logprob": -0.034047503024339676}, {"token": " initially", "logprob": -1.9184001684188843}, {"token": " stated", "logprob": -0.33861270546913147}, {"token": " that", "logprob": -1.168264389038086}, {"token": " the", "logprob": -0.019929055124521255}, {"token": " law", "logprob": -0.9274041652679443}, {"token": " applied", "logprob": -0.11701386421918869}, {"token": " across", "logprob": -0.4298360049724579}, {"token": " the", "logprob": -0.058685775846242905}, {"token": " \""